#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create beautiful,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">accessible<br/><span class=\"platform web\">web</span></span><br/>apps."
msgstr "Skab smukke,<br/><span class=\"platform-line\">tilgængelige<br/><span class=\"platform web\">web</span></span><br/>applikationer."

#: index.md:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "En løst token-model, omformet til stylesheets, framework-bindings, native-kode og payloads til designværktøjer."

#: index.md:10
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Kom godt i gang"

#: index.md:13
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "CSS-reference"

#: index.md:16
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API-reference"

#: index.md:22
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Én sandhedskilde"

#: index.md:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every packages uses the official Instructure design tokens, components, and interactions from <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."
msgstr "Alle pakker bruger de officielle Instructure designtokens, komponenter og interaktioner fra <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Brug den mindste pakke"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid "Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Installer kun @pantoken/css for et stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks og ikoner, eller et bundler-preset for Tailwind, Panda eller MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Generer til enhver platform"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr "Installer pantoken cli for at generere presets eller tilføje komponenter til enhver platform&colon; web, native og alt derimellem."

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr "React er ikke nødvendigt"

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr "InstUI-biblioteket er tæt koblet med React. Hvis du vil bruge det, skal du bruge React. Nu kan du udvikle hvor som helst."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, overalt"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr "Hver pakke læser den samme resolved token-IR. Ændr en token opstrøms, og den flyder til CSS, SCSS, native-kode og Figma på samme måde."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr "Kør `pantoken generate` for at generere Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress og mere. De samme tokens, i hvert økosystems idiom."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Ingen opstrømskobling"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
#~ msgstr "Tokens leveres som vendored statisk JSON, så `npm i` aldrig henter fra en GitHub-only-kilde. Publicerbar, semver'd, offline-venlig."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "The package map"
#~ msgstr "Pakkeoversigt"
